Dưới đây là **full CSS** cho cụm `.middle-header` trên [dncdbt.edu.vn/trang-chu.html](https://dncdbt.edu.vn/trang-chu.html), gom từ 2 file:

- `Styles/public.css?v=2` — class tiện ích layout
- `Styles/style.css?v=12` — style chính + responsive

**Lưu ý:** Class `.name-company`, `.sdt`, `.sdt1` **không có rule riêng** — style đi qua `.middle-header h2`, `.hotline span/strong/small`. Hiệu ứng logo `.peShiner` do JS (`jquery.pixelentity.shiner.min.js`) tạo inline style, không có CSS file riêng.

---

### 1. Font + Animation (bắt buộc)

```css
@font-face {
    font-family: swiss;
    src: url("font/UTM Swiss 721 Black Condensed.ttf");
}

@keyframes zoomIn {
    0%   { transform: scale(0); }
    100% { transform: scale(1); }
}

@keyframes phone-icon {
    0%  { transform: translate3d(0px, 0, 0); }
    2%  { transform: translate3d(2px, 0, 0); }
    4%  { transform: translate3d(-2px, 0, 0); }
    6%  { transform: translate3d(2px, 0, 0); }
    8%  { transform: translate3d(-2px, 0, 0); }
    10% { transform: translate3d(2px, 0, 0); }
    12% { transform: translate3d(-2px, 0, 0); }
    14% { transform: translate3d(2px, 0, 0); }
    16% { transform: translate3d(-2px, 0, 0); }
    18% { transform: translate3d(2px, 0, 0); }
    20% { transform: translate3d(-2px, 0, 0); }
    22% { transform: translate3d(2px, 0, 0); }
    24% { transform: translate3d(-2px, 0, 0); }
    26% { transform: translate3d(2px, 0, 0); }
    28% { transform: translate3d(-2px, 0, 0); }
    30% { transform: translate3d(2px, 0, 0); }
    32% { transform: translate3d(-2px, 0, 0); }
    34% { transform: translate3d(2px, 0, 0); }
    36% { transform: translate3d(-2px, 0, 0); }
    38% { transform: translate3d(2px, 0, 0); }
    40% { transform: translate3d(-2px, 0, 0); }
    42% { transform: translate3d(2px, 0, 0); }
    44% { transform: translate3d(-2px, 0, 0); }
    46% { transform: translate3d(0em, 0, 0); }
}
```

---

### 2. Class tiện ích (từ `public.css`)

```css
.clearfm * {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: none;
    text-decoration: none;
    list-style: none;
    color: inherit;
    line-height: 1.4;
}

.left { float: left; }
.right { float: right; }
.overHide { overflow: hidden; }

.img { display: block; }
.img img {
    width: auto;
    height: 100%;
    min-width: 100%;
}
```

---

### 3. CSS chính cụm middle-header (từ `style.css`)

```css
.container {
    max-width: 1150px;
    margin: auto;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 96%;
}

/* === MIDDLE HEADER === */
.middle-header {
    background: linear-gradient(#0556a3, #0589c6);
    padding-top: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    position: relative;
}

.middle-header .container {
    padding-right: calc(50% - 400px);
    height: 79px;
    overflow: visible;
}

.middle-header .left {
    overflow: visible;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
}

.middle-header:after {
    content: "";
    width: 400px;
    height: 100%;
    background: url(/Design/after-header.png);
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    top: 0;
}

/* Logo */
.middle-header .logo {
    height: 75px;
    width: 75px;
    position: relative;
}

.middle-header .logo:before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    width: 514%;
    height: calc(100% + 20px);
    background: url(/Design/logo-before.png);
    left: calc(-257% + 55px);
    top: -12px;
}

.middle-header .logo a,
.middle-header .logo canvas {
    width: 100% !important;
    height: 100% !important;
    display: block;
    margin: 0 !important;
}

.middle-header .logo a {
    animation: zoomIn 2s;
}

/* Tên trường (h2.name-company) */
.middle-header h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-family: swiss;
    color: #fff;
    margin-left: 20px;
    margin-top: 13px;
}

/* Hotline */
.hotline {
    position: relative;
    background: url(/Design/icon-hotline.png) no-repeat bottom;
    width: 283px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding-left: 80px;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    z-index: 8;
}

.hotline:before {
    content: "\f095";
    font-family: fontawesome;
    position: absolute;
    font-size: 38px;
    color: #fff;
    left: 18px;
    top: 10px;
    animation: phone-icon 3s infinite;
}

.hotline span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #fff;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 1;
}

.hotline strong {
    font-size: 24px;
    color: #fff700;
    display: block;
    line-height: 1.3;
}

.hotline small {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #fff;
    display: block;
    text-align: right;
    padding-right: 10px;
}
```

---

### 4. Responsive

```css
@media only screen and (max-width: 1279px) {
    .middle-header:after {
        display: none;
    }
}

@media only screen and (max-width: 1023px) {
    .hotline {
        padding-left: 0;
        background: 0;
        width: auto;
    }

    .hotline:before {
        content: "";
    }
}

@media only screen and (max-width: 667px) {
    .middle-header h2 {
        font-size: 16px;
        margin-left: 10px;
        margin-top: 0;
    }

    .middle-header .logo {
        height: 50px;
        width: 50px;
    }

    .middle-header .logo:before {
        display: none;
    }

    .middle-header hgroup {
        float: none;
    }

    .hotline {
        float: none;
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 5px;
    }

    .hotline span,
    .hotline strong {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 12px;
    }

    .hotline strong {
        margin-left: 10px;
        font-size: 15px;
    }

    .hotline small {
        text-align: center;
    }

    .hotline span:after {
        content: ":";
    }
}

@media only screen and (max-width: 467px) {
    .middle-header .left {
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .middle-header h2 {
        font-size: 14px;
    }

    .hotline {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 5px;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        text-align: center;
    }
}

@media only screen and (max-width: 400px) {
    .middle-header h2 {
        font-size: 14px;
    }
}
```

---

### 5. Tài nguyên cần kèm theo

| File | Dùng cho |
|------|----------|
| `/Design/logo-before.png` | Vệt sáng phía sau logo |
| `/Design/after-header.png` | Trang trí góc phải header |
| `/Design/icon-hotline.png` | Nền khối hotline |
| `font/UTM Swiss 721 Black Condensed.ttf` | Font tên trường |
| [Font Awesome 4.6.3](https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/4.6.3/css/font-awesome.min.css) | Icon điện thoại `\f095` |
| `/Uploads/images/lg.png` | Logo |
| `../js/jquery.pixelentity.shiner.min.js` | Hiệu ứng bóng logo (tùy chọn) |

Nếu bạn muốn, tôi có thể gộp thành 1 file `.css` hoặc nhúng trực tiếp vào project ASP.NET WebForms của bạn.

